    {
      "id": 96,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5xx errors/sec",
      "description": "Server errors per second, from the application's own counter (game_http_requests_total). nginx-prometheus-exporter reads stub_status, which has NO per-status counters, so errors nginx generates itself — 502 with the game server down, 500 \"worker_connections are not enough\", 504 upstream timeouts — are not in this panel. To see those: (a) build nginx with the VTS module (github.com/vozlt/nginx-module-vts), add `vhost_traffic_status_zone;` in http{} and a `location /status { vhost_traffic_status_display; vhost_traffic_status_display_format prometheus; }`, scrape it and plot sum(rate(nginx_vts_server_requests_total{code=\"5xx\"}[1m])); or (b) run prometheus-nginxlog-exporter (github.com/martin-helmich/prometheus-nginxlog-exporter) on /var/log/nginx/king-teenpatti.access.log and plot sum(rate(nginx_http_response_count_total{status=~\"5..\"}[1m])). MONITORING.md → Nginx has the steps.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 4,
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (status_code) (rate(game_http_requests_total{status_code=~\"5..\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "HTTP {{status_code}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Game server HTTP responses/sec by status class",
      "description": "2xx / 4xx / 5xx share of REST responses. 4xx is mostly 401 from expired tokens and 409 from renaming while seated.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
